Z||000000||baldlobo||11-05-2000||03:23 PM||||My temp light stays on after start up and we've(me and my dad) Changed all the temp related sensors and switches. any one have any ideas whats wrong with it?||||reg||8
Z||000001||Phil||11-05-2000||04:09 PM||||Try disconnecting the wires at the sensor and see if the light goes off, if it does not the wire is leading to the light is grounded out somewhere. Make sure you are playing with the right sensor. There are 3 temp sensors on a V6<p>[This message has been edited by Phil (edited 11-05-2000).]||||reg||1
